ple’s June quarter revenue may have risen by just 6.5%.", "external_links": ["https://www.tumblr.com/widgets/share/tool?posttype=photo&content=https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fuu%2Fapi%2Fres%2F1.2%2FpQKNNDBQeK5F6jMNEUaxeA--~B%2FaD00NDM7dz02MjA7c209MTthcHBpZD15dGFjaHlvbg--%2Fhttp%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen-US%2Fhomerun%2Fmarketrealist.com%2F4bc0b2cebdc6da21d00520b64251950f&url=http%3A%2F%2Fmarketrealist.com%2F2018%2F09%2Fhow-higher-iphone-prices-have-helped-apple%2F%3Futm_source%3Dyahoo%26utm_medium%3Dfeed%26yptr%3Dyahoo%26soc_src%3Dsocial-sh%26soc_trk%3Dtu&clickthroughUrl=http%3A%2F%2Fm"], "published": "2018-09-06T00:00:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-09-06T01:03:28.016+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}